00:09:56,820 --> 00:09:59,300
minimizing a cost function.

146
00:09:59,300 --> 00:10:02,740
And notice, one consequence of that is that it's important for this cost function to

147
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:09,300
have a nice smooth output so that we can find a local minimum by taking little steps downhill.

148
00:10:09,300 --> 00:10:14,140
This is why, by the way, artificial neurons have continuously ranging activations, rather

